tar (scroll to the top of this page -> click `Star` in top right). Stars are how most users hear about Macro because they move us up GitHub's search and trending pages.\n\n<a href=\"https://github.com/macro-inc/macro\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\".github/readme/star-history-dark.svg\" />\n    <img alt=\"Star history for macro-inc/macro, from launch to 3608 stars\" src=\".github/readme/star-history-light.svg\" width=\"100%\" />\n  </picture>\n</a>\n","totalLines":266,"fileSize":19987}}},"modelCallId":"serverGenReqId_d35597d3-fa5f-42e6-b07b-b5b4bc5bef84-13-fbd9"}

